<title>UK: S&amp;P to issue BT/MCI rating statement.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P to issue BT/MCI rating statement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's rating agency said on Monday it would issue an announcement about the ratings implications of the merger between British Telecommunications Plc and MCI Communications Corp soon.</p>
<p>&quot;We are putting out a press release shortly,&quot; S&amp;P analyst Rupert Atkinson told Reuters.</p>
<p>Atkinson said S&amp;P rates British Telecom AAA long-term with a negative outlook and A1 plus short-term.</p>
<p>He said MCI has an A long-term rating and an A1 short-term rating.</p>
<p>British Telecom and MCI announced on Sunday they were set to merge.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6176</p>
</text>
